<Legal title="About Aptora">
  <h1>About Aptora</h1>
  <p class="lg-updated">The AI Document Workspace built for truthful, high-converting career applications.</p>

  <p>Aptora was built with a simple conviction: <strong>Your experience counts, but how you present it matters just as much.</strong> Job seekers face endless ATS filters and vague rejections, while recruiters spend under 7 seconds skimming a resume. Aptora bridges this gap without compromising integrity.</p>

  <h2>Our philosophy: Truthful alignment, not fabrication</h2>
  <p>Most AI resume generators generate fake achievements or flood documents with hallucinated buzzwords. Aptora does the opposite: it operates strictly on the truthful experience you already have. It identifies your strongest real-world proof points, aligns terminology with the target role, closes keyword blindspots, and compiles real, publication-grade LaTeX PDFs that human hiring managers and ATS parsers love.</p>

  <h2>Designed documents, not cookie-cutter layouts</h2>
  <p>Resume templates shouldn't look like generic web builders. Aptora's rendering engine compiles hardened LaTeX directly into clean, typographic single-page or multi-page formats. Every millimeter, margin, font hierarchy, and horizontal rule is mathematically balanced for readability and visual density.</p>

  <h2>Built by Enally</h2>
  <p>Aptora is an independent product incubated and engineered by <strong>Enally</strong>, building tools, ecosystems, and opportunities for modern developers, engineers, and professionals globally.</p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>Have questions, feedback, or enterprise inquiries? We'd love to hear from you. Visit our <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:600;">Contact page</a> or email us at <a href="mailto:support@enally.in" style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:600;">support@enally.in</a>.</p>
